WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:20.186
Poppy was out of gas.

2
00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:23.792
"I can't move!" she said.

3
00:00:23.793 --> 00:00:32.635
"Uh-oh," said Eddy.

4
00:00:32.636 --> 00:00:36.419
Poppy moaned.

5
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:40.476
"This is bad!"

6
00:00:40.477 --> 00:00:45.878
Ms. Fender drove over.

7
00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.447
"Poppy," said Ms. Fender.

8
00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:52.332
"I told you to stop playing.

9
00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:54.798
You didn't listen!"

10
00:00:54.799 --> 00:00:59.721
Poppy looked at the ground.

11
00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:05.483
Jeb pushed her to the garage.

12
00:01:05.484 --> 00:01:19.625
Everyone followed.

13
00:01:19.626 --> 00:01:28.173
Ms. Fender put out the smoke.

14
00:01:28.174 --> 00:01:35.470
She gave Poppy a new tire.

15
00:01:35.471 --> 00:01:47.965
Then Poppy filled her gas tank.

16
00:01:47.966 --> 00:01:52.327
"Um, Ms. Fender," said Poppy.

17
00:01:52.328 --> 00:01:54.801
"I'm sorry I didn't listen.

18
00:01:54.802 --> 00:01:57.944
I was busy playing."

19
00:01:57.945 --> 00:02:00.928
"I know," said Ms. Fender.

20
00:02:00.929 --> 00:02:03.703
"But you can't always play.

21
00:02:03.704 --> 00:02:06.961
You must take care of yourself."

22
00:02:06.962 --> 00:02:12.424
"Okay," said Poppy.

23
00:02:12.425 --> 00:02:19.406
Then she raced over to Eddy.

24
00:02:19.407 --> 00:02:22.316
"Tag!" said Poppy.

25
00:02:22.317 --> 00:02:28.447
"You're it!"
